<view class="page tab-page"><view class="eyebrow">NEWS FROM YOUR CANTEEN</view><view class="title">校园公告</view><view class="note">关于好好吃饭，还有这些小事。</view><view wx:for="{{notices}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row between"><text class="pill">{{item.category}}</text><text class="tiny">{{item.publishedAt}}</text></view><view class="heading"><text>{{item.title}}</text></view><view style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{item.content}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!notices.length}}" class="empty">暂时没有公告，下拉刷新重试。</view><view class="card"><view class="heading"><text>你的声音，我们听见。</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">想对哪个窗口说</text><picker range="{{windows}}" range-key="name" value="{{windowIndex}}" bindchange="window"><view class="select">{{windows[windowIndex].name || '选择窗口'}}　⌄</view></picker></view><textarea class="field" value="{{content}}" bindinput="content" maxlength="500" placeholder="请写下遇到的问题或建议"/><button class="primary full" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">发送反馈</button></view><view wx:if="{{feedback.length}}" class="heading"><text>我的反馈</text></view><view wx:for="{{feedback}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="tiny">{{item.windowName}} · {{item.createdAt}}</view><view class="note" style="color:#3e513b">{{item.content}}</view><view class="split">{{item.reply ? '窗口回复：' + item.reply : '等待窗口回复'}}</view></view></view>
